{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50681","headline":"江南杂题三十首 其十 · 张祜","name":"江南杂题三十首 其十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三峯前望峻，一派上游斜。\n雨过离披草，风吹颠倒查。\n拂林山鹊翅，丛岸野裳（望疑「裳」爲「棠」之误。\n）花。\n好是醉中舞，村桥行数家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}